// ==========================
// ===== NAME ===============
// ==========================
title: WilliamGote_Name
position: 321,343
---
Punk: Billy's my name.
<<form_set_name YarnManager "Billy">>
<<set $asked_name = true>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 5>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight: [In]Hold up, mononymity was outlawed by the Second Republic in June of 28 AT, over twelve years ago. Something's off.[/In]
Force: [Fo]He lied to us! He wanted us to fill out his name wrong on the form.[/Fo]
Force: [Fo]Wait, you didn't fill his name out already, did you? That would be really stupid if you did.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
-> Sounds good to me.
    Punk: I'm sure it does.
-> That's a strange name.
    Punk: Well, its the one I got, so fill it out, boy scout.
-> Your full name can't be just 'Billy'. <<if $last_check_success>> #skillcheck:Force:6 
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 6>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_PassNode>>
    <<else>>
    <<detour WilliamGote_Name_FailNode>>
    <<endif>>
<<jump WilliamGote_Hub>>
===

title: WilliamGote_Name_PassNode
position: -128,328
---
Force: [Fo]That's right, we're not [i]just[/i] powerful, we're smart too.[/Fo]
Insight: [In]You're welcome.[/In]
Punk: You figured it out, oh wise hand of the Republic. Billy's not my government name.
    <<form_set_name YarnManager "William">>
Punk: My pals call me Billy, but the name my ma gave me is William.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 11>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]His tone rises and shifts into an accent as he mentions his mother. Its a sound that was recorded in a different time.[/Em] 
<<endif>>
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 8>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Insight:[In]He still hasn't told us his last name. He must think he's slick.[/In] 
<<endif>>
-> Thank you
-> William... what?
    <<form_set_name YarnManager "William Gote">>
    Punk: William Gote. Not that you care, but its pronounced more like the facial hair, than the animal. 
===

